ICA Toolkit Android Plugin :
Device Smartcard and Fingerprint Plugins for Grabba S Series Jacket and Usb interface device

Supported Android Application Binary Interfaces (ABIs):
	1.armeabi-v7a
	2.arm64-v8a

Dependencies:
grabba-interfaces-release.aar
grabba-sdk-release.aar

